---
title: "InsufficientMaxFeePerGasError_init (Osaka Fork: Transaction Exceptions)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: transaction_max_fee_per_gas, block_base_fee_per_gas received
    q_validate --> q_format: msg = "Insufficient max fee per gas ({max_fee} less than {base_fee})"
    q_format --> q_super: super().__init__(msg)
    q_super --> q_store1: self.transaction_max_fee_per_gas = transaction_max_fee_per_gas
    q_store1 --> [*]: self.block_base_fee_per_gas = block_base_fee_per_gas
    note right of q_store1
        INV-001: Both fee fields are Final[Uint], immutable after construction
        INV-002: transaction_max_fee_per_gas < block_base_fee_per_gas is the condition that triggers this exception
        INV-003: Both fee values are preserved for diagnostic inspection
    end note
